# cabin_lit_spill: the windows' warm light falling on the deck at night: a
# 25% speckle of spill (28, brick that ignores the night) on the boards and
# the rim under a bank. Placed at at_spill_l, and flipped at at_spill_r.
# The anchor, 0,0, is the bank's left foot on the deck.
C 28  L -2,0  L 0,0 2,0  L 4,0 6,0  L 8,0 10,0  L 12,0 14,0  L 16,0 18,0
      L 20,0 22,0  L 25,0 26,0  L 28,0 29,0  L -2,4  L 2,4  L 4,4
      L 6,4  L 8,4  L 10,4  L 14,4  L 18,4  L 22,4
